{"ts":"2026-05-31T19:47:01.768Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"CONTEXT: types/statuses/fields were hard-coded in TS, so projects could not extend pm without code. DECISION: load schema/types.json, statuses.json, fields.json, workflows.json at runtime and merge with defaults; register types via pm schema add-type; custom types cannot redefine built-ins. CONSEQUENCES: any project archetype can model its domain without code; small per-command file reads; git-tracked per-repo customization; discovery/removal CLI surface still thin (see pm-qq69/pm-k8ik). EVIDENCE: src/core/schema/runtime-schema.ts, item-types-file.ts; items pm-e1va/pm-fy8o/pm-x2k0."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-a859"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"ADR: Config-driven runtime schema (4-file model) over hard-coded type/status/field registries"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Config-driven runtime schema (4-file model) over hard-coded type/status/field registries"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Decision"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["adr","architecture","area:config","area:schema"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-05-31T19:47:01.768Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-05-31T19:47:01.768Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-m2u1"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"2b19275b6e0b9f255f7aa073ffa1e2336abda35882f2d3920e2cf93cab0f786e","message":"Record ADR"}
